---Represents a complete policy resource within the AgentCore Policy system. Policies are ARN-able resources that contain Cedar or Dogwood policy statements and associated metadata for controlling agent behavior and access decisions. Each policy belongs to a policy engine and defines fine-grained authorization rules that are evaluated in real-time as agents interact with tools through Gateway. Polici...
---@class aws.bedrock_agentcore_control.Policy
